  "solution": {
    "text": "$2^{3 n}-7 n-1 \\quad$ Taking $n=2 ;$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n2^{6}-7 \\times 2-1 \\\\\r\n\r\n=64-15=49\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\nTherefore this is divisible by 49 .",
